# The process package's tests start and signal real child processes, so a crash there
# drops a multi-megabyte core dump into the package directory. Four of them were committed
# by accident before this file existed; ignore them so it cannot happen again.
core.*
!core.go

# Dependencies resolve from the module proxy, pinned by go.sum (#333). A stray
# `go mod vendor` must not put 4205 files back into the tree.
/vendor/
